# unified-trading-pm
Type: Level 0 workspace management (NOT a Python package or service)
SSOT templates: setup.sh, quality-gates.sh, quickmerge.sh, version-bump.yml — edit ONLY here, then propagate
workspace-manifest.json changes require: python3 scripts/manifest/generate_workspace_dag.py
Python scripts: basedpyright + ruff (line-length 120); tests: pytest tests/ + bats tests/
PM scripts may use env vars for CI (unlike service repos which use UnifiedCloudConfig)
Workspace rules: see root .cursorrules and .cursor/rules/
